  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing cognitive rehabilitation capabilities for children with disabilities in Kigamboni, Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is implementing the cognitive rehabilitation competency program for children with disabilities in the Kigamboni region of Tanzania to improve the quality of life of children with cognitive disabilities by guaranteeing their rights to health and education. To this end, we plan to implement a support project for children with disabilities with the core contents of 1) enhancing the cognitive rehabilitation abilities of children with disabilities, and 2) strengthening the education capabilities of special education teachers for children with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
